From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 23:07:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02207/11362] [outer-loop] rich candidates (no 12-cap) -> r11l
 SOLVES adapter-free in 3 actions

graph_explore_solve_v2 now uses rich_action_candidates (every detected object is a
click candidate; r11l's winning clicks were objects #15/#27 the old 12-cap dropped).
r11l + ls20 both solve adapter-free now + full capture->gate->seed pipeline. wa30
(~33-deep keyboard) still needs a value-guided deeper search (next).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
